cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Demo 37: Detector Cost (teaching toy)"
message: >-
  If you use this teaching demo in coursework, please cite it as below.
  All inputs, scores and verdicts are synthetic; this is not research
  evidence.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Radanliev
    given-names: Petar
license: MIT
keywords:
  - teaching
  - prompt-injection
  - detector-evaluation
  - cost-sensitive
  - synthetic-fixtures
abstract: >-
  Teaching toy comparing strict and lenient prompt-injection detectors
  under asymmetric error costs (FP=10, FN=25). Ten synthetic prompts,
  two substring rules, stdlib only.
